        "eyebrow": "Vs overshoes",
        "heading": "Compared with overshoes",
        "lede": "<p>Most people reading this already own a pair. This isn’t an argument that they’re useless — it’s what each one is actually good at.</p>",
        "table_caption": "Waterproof socks and overshoes, and what each one is actually good at.",
        "col_criterion": "What matters",
